"scrobbler was active (now playing, or scrobbling around it) happened on "
"its device, so it is left to that scrobbler, skips included. Turn off if "
"that scrobbler also scrobbles other players."
msgstr ""

#: web/templates/partials/_panel_settings.html:657
msgid "Fastest poll interval (minutes)"
msgstr ""

#: web/templates/partials/_panel_settings.html:661
#, python-format
msgid ""
