"shorter interval bounds listening times more tightly, so more decisions "
"are certain. The documentation has the numbers."
msgstr ""

#: web/templates/partials/_panel_settings.html:664
msgid "Idle poll interval (minutes)"
msgstr ""

#: web/templates/partials/_panel_settings.html:668
#, python-format
